    <unit id="LastNodeAndReversingDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>When the timeline is incomplete and ongoing, put a pending node at the end. Set Pending to a truthy value to display the pending item. You can customize the pending content and pending icon. IsReverse is used for reversing nodes.</source>
        <target state="translated">當時間軸未完成且仍在進行時，可在最後放置一個待處理節點。將 Pending 設置為有效值可顯示待處理項；也可以自定義待處理內容和待處理圖標。IsReverse 用於反轉節點。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
